Package: flamewm
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: ArkFlame Studios <maintainers@arkflame.dev>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.36), libgcc-s1, libx11-6, libxi6, libxkbcommon0, libdbus-1-3, libpulse0, libpam0g, libpam-runtime, libxft2, libfontconfig1, libgbm1, libdrm2, libinput10, libudev1, libegl1, libgles2, python3, xwayland
Recommends: libxcursor1, libxext6, libxrender1, libxcomposite1, libxdamage1, libx11-xcb1, libwayland-client0, libwayland-egl1, xdg-utils, libnotify-bin, dunst, fontconfig, systemd | elogind, xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
Suggests: x11-xserver-utils, x11-utils, dex, ffmpeg, imagemagick, ark, zip, curl, udisks2, policykit-1-gnome, polkit-kde-agent-1, xdg-desktop-portal-kde, libxkbcommon-x11-0, fonts-ibm-plex
Description: FlameWM X11 window manager
 FlameWM is a Rust X11 window manager with native WebRender-compatible UI.
